🔐 Security

The GitHub version is intentionally sanitized.

The portfolio export does not contain:

API keys

Gmail credentials

Google Sheets credential bindings

Webhook IDs

Production Google Sheet IDs/URLs

Production task ownership IDs

Before importing the sanitized workflow into n8n, replace the placeholders such as:

<YOUR_TURBO_API_KEY>
<GOOGLE_SHEET_ID>
<GOOGLE_SHEET_URL>
<BOARD_ID>
<LIST_ID>
<USER_CODE>

with your own environment-specific values and credentials.

